Name":"darrell_tw_","content":"詐騙猖獗\n目前推測這帳號高機率不是本人\n晚點應該就會推薦股票或是說有 line 群了！","timestamp":"2026-10-27T06:27:52.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-10-27T16:32:43+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De9dSDLn7PU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De9dSDLn7PU","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"使喚 Grok Bot 的 n 種方法\n\n好不容易花了 30 美金以上\n卻只有用 Grok Bot App 嗎？\n\n其實你還有很多種方法可以使喚它\n只要串個 Cloudflare 或類似服務\n甚至還能直接串到你的 Line OA\n\n一個最簡單 Line AI 客服可能就上線了\n(但你得做好很多準備才對，不是這樣串一串就開放使用)\n\n各種串接的方法超簡單\n有興趣歡迎留言\n再提供教學給大家","timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:06:04.000Z","stats":{"likes":59,"replies":6,"reposts":6,"shares":34},"score":89,"first_seen":"2026-10-27T04:52:15+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De-03XVn1uN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De-03XVn1uN","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"文章連結：\nshort.darrelltw.com/grok…","timestamp":"2026-10-27T02:51:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-10-27T16:32:43+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De8vl-9ETyn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De8vl-9ETyn","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"突然覺得挺有趣的\nAI 現在已經算蠻強了\n\n但當截圖軟體問我要不要續約一年的時候\n我還是會想要同意\n而不是想要自己做一個\n\n到底是因為它太便宜\n還是我覺得還做不出一個更好用的","timestamp":"2026-10-26T07:26:50.000Z","stats":{"likes":17,"replies":9,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":35,"first_seen":"2026-10-27T04:52:15+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De6EBzEkYnX","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De6EBzEkYnX","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"每日任務：對 Google AI 吐槽 (1/1)\n\nArgon 模型到底多嬌貴\n獨立一個 weekly limit 就算了\n連 reset 時間都是獨立的？\n\n假設你昨天 12 點 weekly reset\n只要你不去用 argon 他的 reset 時間就不會跑","timestamp":"2026-10-25T06:27:40.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-10-27T04:52:15+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"De4X1Urnx7K","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De4X1Urnx7K","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"這邊有產出影片的樣片可以看喔","timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:42:15.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":12,"first_seen":"2026-10-27T04:52:15+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"De4T42NH0KC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/De4T42NH0KC","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"出外旅行拍一大堆影片\n到底怎麼讓 AI 幫忙整理才有效率\n\n1. 檔案其實都有時間，用時間很快就能判斷出是不是同一個景點\n\n2. 讓 AI 去讀懂影片的重點，請他用 ffmpeg 截圖\n\n3. 如果能額外提供 GPX 檔案，AI 就能知道你一整天在哪裡，海拔高度多少，移動速度多少\n\n補：如果你的相機無法紀錄 GPS，可以用手機下載 App \n(我是用 OsmAnd Maps)\n可以設定每分鐘紀錄一次當下 GPS 資訊，最後匯出 GPX 檔案\n\n後續要自己剪影片，或是交給 AI 剪\n都能快速找到素材在哪\n\n追蹤就能看到下一 part\nAI 怎麼產生旅遊影片！","timestamp":"2026-10-24T14:07:46.000Z","stats":{"likes":241,"replies":15,"reposts":41,"shares":287},"score":394,"first_seen":"2026-10-27T04:52:15+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"De3v6jLm_F_","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/De3v6jLm_F_","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"我整理了一份「不是大公司也能申請」的 SaaS 新創額度。\n​\n官網上那些大數字，像「最高 35 萬美元」，幾乎都要有創投或加速器推薦。\n沒募資的一人公司，實際拿得到的是 1 萬美元這個等級。\n​\n不過一年 1 萬美元的伺服器額度，對剛上線的 App 已經很夠用了。\n​\n這次整理了 4 家可以申請的方案：\n◼ Cloudflare\n◼ PostHog\n◼ Mixpanel\n◼ ElevenLabs\n​\n產品還沒上線的話，也附上可以先撐著用的免費方案。\n​\n收藏起來，或分享給正在做產品的朋友 ✨\n​\n金額為 2026 年 10 月官網資料，申請前以官網為準。","timestamp":"2026-10-24T08:53:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":97,"replies":2,"reposts":18,"shares":163},"score":155,"first_seen":"2026-10-27T04:52:15+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}